00:01:26.377 --> 00:01:27.504
<c.bg_transparent>Bukan begitu, Yami?</c.bg_transparent>

00:01:28.296 --> 00:01:30.089
<c.bg_transparent>Kombinasi warna yang polos.</c.bg_transparent>

00:01:30.799 --> 00:01:32.342
