00:23:01.338 --> 00:23:03.006
<c.bg_transparent><i>Pujalah aku.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:23:05.217 --> 00:23:07.094
<c.bg_transparent>Aku Noelle Silva.</c.bg_transparent>

00:23:07.177 --> 00:23:08.386
<c.bg_transparent>Aku anggota kerajaan.</c.bg_transparent>

00:23:08.595 --> 00:23:10.013
<c.bg_transparent>Seorang bandit?</c.bg_transparent>

00:23:10.514 --> 00:23:12.349
<c.bg_transparent>Siapa yang kau sebut bandit?</c.bg_transparent>

00:23:12.808 --> 00:23:15.102
<c.bg_transparent>"Anggota kerajaan".</c.bg_transparent>

00:23:15.268 --> 00:23:16.645
<c.bg_transparent>Perompak?</c.bg_transparent>

00:23:17.187 --> 00:23:18.980
<c.bg_transparent>Siapa yang kau sebut perompak?</c.bg_transparent>

00:23:19.106 --> 00:23:21.066
<c.bg_transparent>"Anggota kerajaan"!</c.bg_transparent>

00:23:21.650 --> 00:23:22.943
<c.bg_transparent>Keluarga?</c.bg_transparent>

00:23:23.860 --> 00:23:25.779
<c.bg_transparent>Bodoh.</c.bg_transparent>

00:23:28.073 --> 00:23:29.825
<c.bg_transparent><i>Misi pertamaku dalam Kesatria Sihir.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:23:29.908 --> 00:23:33.495
<c.bg_transparent><i>Baiklah. Aku akan bekerja dengan baik
dan menjadi Kaisar Sihir.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:23:33.578 --> 00:23:35.747
<c.bg_transparent><i>Apa? Misiku adalah berburu babi hutan?</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:23:35.997 --> 00:23:37.999
<c.bg_transparent>Black Clover, </c.bg_transparent><c.bg_transparent><i>Halaman 8,</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:23:38.083 --> 00:23:39.501
<c.bg_transparent><i>"Ayo! Ayo! Misi Pertamaku."</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:23:39.584 --> 00:23:41.086
<c.bg_transparent><i>Sihirku adalah tak pernah menyerah!</i></c.bg_transparent>

